OL,3,GNEWSAArcades and bingo halls raise duty
OL,4,Aconcerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FBingo hall and amusement arcade
OL,7,Foperators have warned they could be
OL,8,Fforced to close if gambling taxes rise
OL,9,Fin the Budget.
OL,11,FIt comes as a group of 90 Labour MPs
OL,12,Fco-signed a letter to Chancellor John
OL,13,FHealey, calling for him to raise the
OL,14,FMachine Games Duty (MGD) on Category B
OL,15,Fmachines. These give cash prizes, such
OL,16,Fas slot, fruit and quiz machines.
OL,18,FSarah Calakovic, regional manager at
OL,19,FBuzz Bingo in Medway, Kent, told BBC
OL,20,FSouth East a 5% rise could "put 40% of
OL,21,Four clubs into loss-making territory".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
